WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.080
The Kardashians have redefined
the American dream.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:08.560
The Kardashian women,
they are superior to rich men now.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.520
You're kind of in one of two camps.

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.240
I want to talk about them.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.480
Or, they've ruined the world.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.600
Oh, my God.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.000
Anyway, here we go.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.640
Kris wanted to be more
than just a housewife.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:24.160
Kimberly calculated 
from the beginning...

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:25.920
“How do I become famous?”

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.200
The sex tape was a 
means to an end.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.240
It was to create a controversy.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:35.080
What was it like working 
with your wife?

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.920
(Laughter)

